  "doubts": "The page says the track ends at Martins Bay; the last stage ends at Martins Bay Hut (T21), which I used as the end rather than the Martins Bay coast entry (T20). Start F1 is where the Hollyford Track meets Lower Hollyford Road (F2 is the Humboldt Falls Track). The text offers returning on the same track or by transport; DOC gives '56 km one way', so one_way. The McKerrow Island Hut side trip leaves the Lake Alabaster Hut to Demon Trail Hut section, but the exact turn-off point is not stated. Sunshine Hut (private) and Pyke River Lodge are passed on the way and listed as huts; Martins Bay Lodge is at a turn off and its position relative to the track is unclear. The order of Jerusalem Creek relative to Martins Bay Hut is not fully clear. The track continues beyond the hut to Long Reef and then the Pyke - Big Bay Route; not recorded as part of this walk."
